sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Instructor
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant Auth as AuthRouter
    participant API as InstructorRouter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Instructor,Auth: Authentication Flow
    Instructor->>UI: Enter username and password
    UI->>Auth: POST /login with credentials
    Auth->>DB: Fetch user by username
    DB-->>Auth: Return user with hashed password
    Auth->>Auth: Verify bcrypt hash
    Auth-->>UI: Set JWT in HTTP-only cookie
    UI-->>Instructor: Redirect to Instructor Dashboard

    Note over Instructor,DB: View Assignments and Submissions
    Instructor->>UI: Navigate to Assignments page
    UI->>API: GET /instructor/assignments with JWT
    API->>DB: Fetch assignments for instructor sections
    DB-->>API: List of assignments with submission counts
    API-->>UI: Assignment list JSON
    UI-->>Instructor: Display assignments and submission buttons

    Note over Instructor,DB: Grading a Student Submission
    Instructor->>UI: Click Grade on a submission
    Instructor->>UI: Enter score and written feedback
    UI->>API: POST /instructor/grade with submission_id score feedback
    API->>DB: is_teacher_of_section check
    DB-->>API: Authorised
    API->>DB: UPDATE assignment_submissions SET score feedback graded_at
    DB-->>API: Update confirmed
    API-->>UI: 200 OK response
    UI-->>Instructor: Show success toast notification
    Note right of DB: Student can now view grade in their portal
